"#24313f\">at 8 layers: HGNN loses 43.19,</text><text x=\"299\" y=\"403\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#24313f\">RD 34.00, DD 26.53</text><text x=\"299\" y=\"421\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#7a8699\">carried by Table VIII</text><rect x=\"550\" y=\"342\" width=\"250\" height=\"86\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#e9f9ef\" stroke=\"#c3ecd4\"/><text x=\"564\" y=\"366\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#16a34a\">The embedding is framework-general</text><text x=\"564\" y=\"386\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#24313f\">all 18 deltas positive across six</text><text x=\"564\" y=\"403\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#24313f\">backbones; all 6 positive on plain GNNs</text><text x=\"564\" y=\"421\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#7a8699\">carried by Tables IX and X</text><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"452\" x2=\"800\" y2=\"452\" stroke=\"#e5e8ee\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"476\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#dc2626\" letter-spacing=\"1\">WHAT DOES NOT BALANCE</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"490\" width=\"780\" height=\"96\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fff5f5\" stroke=\"#f5c2c2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"514\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#24313f\">14 ledger entries · cards 112 and 113. The four that change a reader's conclusion:</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"536\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#24313f\">· inductive share is 40%, not the stated 20% — the production benchmark is harder than described</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"554\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#24313f\">· Github reads +0.00 where the value is −0.09 — a sign, not a rounding</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"572\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#24313f\">· Table IX reports 18 accuracies without naming its dataset · average ranks quoted 1.9 / 1.7, printed 1.7 / 1.5</text></svg></div>",
